      "content": "`typeof null` 的返回值是什么？",
      "options": [
        { "id": "a", "text": "'null'" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "'undefined'" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "'object'" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "'number'" }
      ],
      "correctAnswers": ["c"],
      "explanation": "这是 JavaScript 的历史遗留 bug，typeof null 返回 'object'。",
